{
  "_comment": "Functional role archetypes. Raw position (DEF/MID/FWD) is far too coarse to predict events: an inverted winger and a traditional winger are both 'MID' but differ by a factor of two in shots and by the opposite in crosses. Each archetype carries a full per-90 profile, so every player has every metric even when only a handful of stats are known for them individually. Explicit per-player per90 values always override these.",
  "_units": "All values are per 90 minutes. 'fouls' is fouls COMMITTED; 'foulsDrawn' is fouls suffered. 'aerials' is duels contested, 'aerialsWon' a subset. 'saves' is goalkeeper-only.",
  "_calibration": "Archetype baselines reflect typical Premier League output for the role. Replace with fitted per-role averages from event data when you have it.",
